  (text "2.5 kHz, Q 0.70\n0 to +6 dB" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 63.5 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "329d69a8-92ec-5092-8470-7e5073742962"))
  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes, stage 7. The pedal's Bite switch adds a presence boost [1]; its circuit is not public.\nUX7: a graphic-EQ band (chosen), +6 dB at 2.5 kHz, Q 0.7 (presF, presDb, presQ). LX2 is a simulated inductor (gyrator).\nRVX7 runs from its centre (flat, Bite 0) to the boost end (Bite 100); the pedal's switch would select the two ends." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cd41023d-686c-5df2-9407-fdc42375f8d8"))
